# What the CLI deploy (`vercel deploy --prod --archive=tgz` from the repo root)
# must not upload: local installs (their symlinks point at this machine, and
# turbo trips on them on Vercel, which installs its own) and local reports.
**/node_modules
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
e2e-reports
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
.e2e
.claude
